                        <h2 class="title">这有鲁迅先生用过的显微镜和解剖刀，鲁迅长孙周令飞专程来看</h2>
                        <!-- 副标题 -->
                        <h3 class="subTitle"><span></span></h3>
                        <script>
                        $(".Subheading span:empty").parent().hide()
                        </script>
                        <div class="property"> <span>文章来源：本站原创</span> <span>作者：佚名</span> <span>发布时间：2016年10月13日</span> <span>点击数：
    <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/Common/GetHits.aspx?id=5723"></script>
    次</span>  <span><span id="content_AdminEdit"></span>
<script type="text/javascript">
$(document).ready(function()
{
    $.pe.ajax('admineditcheck',{params:{itemId:5723},success:function(s) {
        if ($(s).find('status').text() == 'OK') {
            var managedir = "/Common/GetContentEdit.aspx?itemId=5723";
           $("#content_AdminEdit").html("【<a href='" + managedir + "' target='_blank'>进入后台编辑</a>】")
        }
    }});
});
</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT face=宋体 size=3>这些鲁迅先生用过的物品包括一只日本东京产的袖珍显微镜实验教具，至今还乌黑发亮，显微镜的布包都还保存完好。<SPAN lang=EN-US>25</SPAN>把解剖刀、小钳子，一枚十分漂亮的无患树科生物标本，此外，还有<SPAN lang=EN-US>229</SPAN>幅博物图谱等都保存完好。</FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">“</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>这是我第一次看到爷爷使用过的显微镜，也是第一次知道绍兴一中还有这么多的爷爷使用过的物品。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">”</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>昨天上午，鲁迅长孙周令飞专程来到绍兴市第一中学（以下简称</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">“</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>绍兴一中</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">”</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">），参观爷爷工作过的地方，并仔细观看了鲁迅留下的袖珍显微镜、解剖刀和生物标本、博物图谱，他用手机一一拍下了这些珍贵的物品。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">1910</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>年</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">9</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>月，鲁迅先生由浙江两级师范学堂来当时的绍兴府中学堂（绍兴一中前身）任监学（教务主任）兼博物教员一年。鲁迅在学校工作期间提倡</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">“</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>读活书</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">”</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">，接触社会实际，注重实验实习，组织师生到南京参观南洋劝业会，带领学生去野外采集博物标本，还带领学生武装演说队上街宣传，并亲率学生出城欢迎革命人士王金发的武装，他还亲编教材，并将从日本带回的显微镜、标本、博物图谱等作为教学用具。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>昨天，记者随周令飞一起看到了鲁迅先生用过的物品：一只日本东京产的袖珍显微镜实验教具，至今还乌黑发亮，显微镜的布包都还保存完好。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">25</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>把解剖刀、小钳子，一枚十分漂亮的无患树科生物标本，此外，还有</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">229</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>幅博物图谱等都保存完好。这些东西都是鲁迅从日本带回来的。其中一批博物图谱是鲁迅在</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">1910</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>年到府中学堂时带来的，还有一批是</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">1911</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>年鲁迅去日本接其三弟时带回来的。尽管</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">100</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">多年过去了，这些博物图谱依然字迹清楚。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>绍兴一中校长朱雯告诉周令飞，鲁迅先生用过的物件十分珍贵。抗日战争期间，绍兴一中被迫搬迁，从诸暨到东阳、新昌、嵊州、台州等地，共搬迁了八九个地方，师生们不畏艰辛将这些物件随身携带着，一路颠沛流离，没有丢弃一件。这深深表达了师生们对鲁迅先生的崇敬之情。周令飞听了后十分感动，他在绍兴一中校史陈列室，挥毫写下了</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">“</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>不忘初心</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">”4</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">个字。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">绍兴府中学堂原址在城市广场对面的绍兴一中初中部，至今这里还保留一幢鲁迅先生工作过的小楼，里面有鲁迅先生的办公室，鲁迅亲手种植的白玉兰和两棵枣树，都生长完好。校园里树有鲁迅塑像，以鼓励学子们努力学习，为振兴中华而读书。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>在一本照片集中，周令飞对一张</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">“</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma"><FONT face=宋体>绍兴府中学堂之春季旅行于禹陵之纪念合影</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma">”</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: Tahoma; mso-hansi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma">图片仔细端详，这张照片是鲁迅在学校教学时留下的合影照。他希望绍兴一中能保护好这些物件，充分利用好这些文物，宣传好鲁迅精神，让学生走近鲁迅。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 210pt; mso-char-indent-count: 20.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">摘自掌上绍兴</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>2016</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">日</SPAN> <SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">星期六</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: Tahoma"><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P align=center> </P>
    
